TI  - Incorporating coastal blue carbon into subnational greenhouse gas inventories
T2  - FRONTIERS IN MARINE SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - coastal wetlands
KW  - mangrove
KW  - Hainan
KW  - climate change
KW  - land use change (LUC)
