TI  - The coupled uncertainties in carbon dioxide removal and transient climate response to cumulative CO2 emissions
T2  - ENVIRONMENTAL RESEARCH LETTERS
LA  - English
KW  - carbon dioxide removal
KW  - ocean alkalinity enhancement
KW  - reforestation
KW  - transient climate response to cumulative CO2 emissions
KW  - perturbed parameter ensemble
KW  - University of Victoria Earth system climate model
