TI  - Nutrient utilization and diatom productivity changes in the low-latitude south-eastern Atlantic over the past 70 ka: response to Southern Ocean leakage
T2  - CLIMATE OF THE PAST
LA  - English
KW  - BENGUELA UPWELLING SYSTEM
KW  - SILICON ISOTOPES
KW  - PACIFIC
KW  - OPAL
KW  - SHIFT
KW  - FRACTIONATION
