TI  - Weak overturning circulation and high Southern Ocean nutrient utilization maximized glacial ocean carbon
T2  - EARTH AND PLANETARY SCIENCE LETTERS
LA  - English
KW  - Last Glacial Maximum
KW  - ocean circulation
KW  - carbon cycle
KW  - IRON FERTILIZATION
KW  - CO2 CHANGE
