TI  - Priorities in policy and management when existing biodiversity stressors interact with climate-change
T2  - CLIMATIC CHANGE
LA  - English
KW  - LAND-USE CHANGE
KW  - BIOLOGICAL INVASIONS
KW  - FRESH-WATER
KW  - ASSISTED COLONIZATION
