TI  - Responsive CO2 capture: predictive multi-objective optimisation for managing intermittent flue gas and renewable energy supply
T2  - REACTION CHEMISTRY & ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - CARBON-DIOXIDE CAPTURE
KW  - FLEXIBLE OPERATION
