TI  - River-Coast Connectivity Controls Ecosystem Services and Blue Carbon of Coastal Nature-Based Solutions: An Integrated Study Coupling Emergy-Carbon Footprint Accounting and Neural Network Modeling
T2  - JOURNAL OF MARINE SCIENCE AND ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - coastal sustainability
KW  - nature-based solutions
KW  - river-coast connectivity
